  "version": 1,
  "id": "red_planet",
  "name": "Mars",
  "description": "Rust-red Martian plain under a dusty butterscotch sky. A white hab dome connects by corridor to a greenhouse dome glowing with pink grow lights, beside a hangar and supply crates. A tall rocket stands on a landing pad by its gantry, ringed by blue beacons, near fuel tanks and a cargo lander. Solar panels and satellite dishes keep the base running. Astronauts work among boulders and impact craters; a meteorite rests in the largest crater, where something small and green lurks.",
